## Scope

The MIT grant above covers the **source code** of this repository: the Astro
components, layouts, styles, scripts, configuration, and CI tooling. Take it,
learn from it, reuse it.

It does **not** cover the **portfolio content**, which is
"All rights reserved, copyright (c) 2026 Raymond Baker":

- Biographical and experience copy, and project descriptions
- The resume in `public/resume.pdf` and any derivative of it
- Photographs, logos, and the monogram or other identifying marks

This is a deliberate split. The code is a work sample and is meant to be
copyable; a personal biography and resume are not, and a permissive license
over them would invite reuse that was never intended. Reusing the structure
to build your own portfolio is welcome and expected — republishing someone
else's professional history is not.
